{
  "name": "40 · Vendor PO Sender (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 40 · Vendor PO Sender\nEvery Monday it finds low-stock items, groups them **by supplier**, gives each a PO number, and AI writes one purchase order email per supplier as a **Gmail draft**. You get a WhatsApp summary, check the drafts and click send.\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Stock**: SKU, Item, In stock, Reorder level, Order qty, Unit, Vendor, Last price. Tab **Vendors**: Vendor, Contact, Email, Phone. Tab **PO log**.\n2. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n3. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n4. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).",
        "height": 637,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "384f3ad5-db1c-41fe-99fc-d20a40d9e8ab",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 11
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "22ce9497-bfae-4c44-a708-c3981e8a2a3c",
      "name": "Monday 11 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
